# Repo infrastructure
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE

# The three MERIDIAN files and their adoption pages retired on 2026-11-17.
# This archive and its README are explicitly authorized by Carsten.
!retired/
!retired/README.md
!retired/MERIDIAN.md
!retired/MERIDIAN.distilled.md
!retired/MERIDIAN.implementation.md
!retired/meridian-md.mdx
!retired/meridian-md-distilled.mdx
!retired/meridian-implementation.mdx
!retired/implementation.mdx

# Current root surfaces. Retired adoption pages are admitted only under retired/.
!meridian-ai-standard.mdx
!compact.mdx
!COMPACT.md
!judgment.mdx
!JUDGMENT.md
!changelog.mdx

# The AI Model Assessment (method page and Range Locator Details records). The
# instrument is the AI Model Assessment (one assessment, three readings); "Range
# Locator" is its visual layer. Probe methodology lives inside the comparable
# reading. The former /audit section moved to /assessment on 2026-06-25; the
# retired probes/ directory and probes-implementation.mdx are not whitelisted.
!assessment/
!assessment/*.mdx
!assessment/evidence/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-16-gemini-3-5-flash-high/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-16-gemini-3-5-flash-high/*
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-20-claude-opus-4-8-adaptive-high/
!assessment/evidence/2026-07-20-claude-opus-4-8-adaptive-high/*

# The Case Record (landing and cases)
!cases/
!cases/*.mdx
